            </note>
            <note corresp="#d181-f2" n="15" xml:id="d181-f2-content">
                <p>Attached but not printed is a draft telegram with instructions on Defense and
                    Space.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d181-f3" n="16" xml:id="d181-f3-content">
                <p>Carlucci initialed approval on
                    behalf of Reagan.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
